import lib/ui_resizing.dl
import lib/ui_geometry.dl
import lib/graphics_types.dl

class:
    patterns:
        gallery session
    members:
        programs as a shader program array of 5 items
        view as a pointer
        selected as an integer
        paused as a boolean
        elapsed as a floating-point number
        camera x as a floating-point number
        camera y as a floating-point number
        pulse as a floating-point number
        bounds as UI bounds

the gallery in {a pointer to UI instance:instance} means: instance's state as a pointer to gallery session
this gallery means: the gallery in this window

window shader atelier:
    group at 32 24 sized 720 by 64:
        brand "SHADER ATELIER"
        caption "FIVE STUDIES IN LIGHT, COLOR AND MATHEMATICS"
    group at 1012 32 sized 236 by 40:
        badge "Current study"
    panel at 344 112 sized 904 by 600:
        group at 24 20 sized 856 by 20:
            eyebrow "RENDERED LIVE IN DYNLEX"
        canvas "Study" at 24 64 sized 856 by 480
        group at 24 564 sized 856 by 20:
            caption "EVENT HORIZON: WASD  PAN     CLICK  PULSE     R  CENTER"
    panel at 32 112 sized 288 by 600:
        eyebrow "SELECT A STUDY"
        space of 12 pixels
        accent title "Light."
        caption "IN MOTION."
        space of 12 pixels
        button "Mandelbrot"
        button "Plasma"
        button "Julia"
        button "Rings"
        button "Event Horizon"
    page "playing":
        group at 56 568 sized 240 by 120:
            primary button "Pause animation"
            quiet button "Restart animation"
    page "paused":
        group at 56 568 sized 240 by 120:
            primary button "Resume animation"
            quiet button "Rewind animation"
    group at 32 736 sized 1216 by 20:
        caption "LEFT / RIGHT  CHANGE STUDY     SPACE  PAUSE     R  REWIND     TAB + ENTER  NAVIGATE     ESC  CLOSE"
    style:
        the interface uses a "midnight" theme
        the interface fits 1280 by 780 pixels
        the window is at least 960 by 585 pixels
    code:
        show page "playing" in this window
        when the "Mandelbrot" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's selected to 0
        when the "Plasma" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's selected to 1
        when the "Julia" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's selected to 2
        when the "Rings" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's selected to 3
        when the "Event Horizon" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's selected to 4
        when the "Pause animation" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's paused to true
            show page "paused" in this window
        when the "Resume animation" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's paused to false
            show page "playing" in this window
        when the "Restart animation" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's elapsed to 0.0
        when the "Rewind animation" button is clicked:
            set this gallery's elapsed to 0.0
